From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 approved bulk extension imports (ABI 1.53)

Bridge 0.56.0. Add profile-scoped WebstoreStandaloneInstaller batches and
UnpackedInstaller loads. ReArc's import consent replaces only the prompt;
Chromium retains manifest matching, signature, blocklist and policy checks.
Keep HTTP not-found/no-update distinct from transport errors. All upstream
seams are additive, preserving other installer consumers.

Last rebased: 2026-11-09 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

